# Features

* Search
    - limit results
    - pagination
    - styling
* Commenting
    - notify on pushover with links to mark as not spam etc.

# Visual

* Desktop styles
* Slideshow functionality
    - start slideshows as paused until you press play? (https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/carousels/)
    - buttons for next / previous
* Comment parenting
